  "content": "<!--\nrdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"\n         xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n         xmlns:trackback=\"http://madskills.com/public/xml/rss/module/trackback/\">\n    <rdf:Description\n        rdf:about=\"/abs/2611.12304\"\n        dc:identifier=\"/abs/2611.12304\"\n        dc:title=\"Evolving Infra: Agent-Adaptive LLM Serving at Scale\"\n        trackback:ping=\"/trackback/2611.12304\" />\n    </rdf:RDF>\n-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"abs-outer\">\n   <div class=\"leftcolumn\">\n    <div class=\"subheader\">\n     <h1>Computer Science &gt; Distributed, Parallel, and Cluster Computing</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-breadcrumbs-mobile\">\n     <strong>arXiv:2611.12304</strong> (cs)\n    </div>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/static/base/1.0.1/css/abs.css\">\n    <div id=\"content-inner\">\n     <div id=\"abs\">\n      <div class=\"dateline\">\n       [Submitted on 9 Nov 2026 (<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304v1\">v1</a>), last revised 12 Nov 2026 (this version, v2)]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"authors\">\n       <span class=\"descriptor\">Authors:</span><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kang,+H\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hao Kang</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xu,+W\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weili Xu</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li,+Z\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ziyang Li</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Du,+Z\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zheng Du</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li,+H\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hanchen Li</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xia,+T\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tian Xia</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bian,+S\" rel=\"nofollow\">Song Bian</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Krishna,+T\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tushar Krishna</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mao,+H\" rel=\"nofollow\">Huizi Mao</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Stoica,+I\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ion Stoica</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Han,+S\" rel=\"nofollow\">Song Han</a>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.12304\">View PDF</a> <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2611.12304v2\">HTML (experimental)</a>\n      <blockquote class=\"abstract mathjax\">\n       <span class=\"descriptor\">Abstract:</span>Agentic workloads are a major source of LLM inference demand. Existing prefill--decode (PD) disaggregated serving systems offer limited flexibility for runtime adaptation of compute allocation and KV cache management, and rely on coarse signals that only partly capture the diverse and dynamic agent workload. These limitations lead to load imbalance between prefill and decode nodes and eviction of KV caches that agents will reuse. We present Evolving Infra, an agent-adaptive serving framework that adapts compute allocation to agent workloads and KV cache management to agent context management at runtime. We decouple compute allocation from key--value (KV) cache management, allowing nodes to switch efficiently between prefill and decode. Building on this design, an online planner matches the PD split to workload composition, while an agent-aware distributed KV manager guides cache eviction and transfer with signals from agent context management. Across coding, math, and computer-use tasks with GLM-5.2 and Kimi K2.6 on up to 256 GB300 GPUs, Evolving Infra reduces mean end-to-end request latency and P95 TTFT by up to 4.1x and 14x over Dynamo, NVIDIA's production framework. We open-source the system implementation of Evolving Infra at <a href=\"https://github.com/mit-han-lab/EvolvingInfra\" rel=\"external noopener nofollow\" class=\"link-external link-https\">this https URL</a>.\n      </blockquote>\n      <!--CONTEXT-->\n      <div class=\"metatable\">\n       <table summary=\"Additional metadata\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Comments:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell comments mathjax\">We just modify some intro and add link to the previou paper</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Subjects:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell subjects\"><span class=\"primary-subject\">Distributed, Parallel, and Cluster Computing (cs.DC)</span></td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Cite as:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxivid\"><span class=\"arxivid\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304\">arXiv:2611.12304</a> [cs.DC]</span></td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxividv\">(or <span class=\"arxivid\"> <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304v2\">arXiv:2611.12304v2</a> [cs.DC]</span> for this version)</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxivdoi\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2611.12304\" id=\"arxiv-doi-link\">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2611.12304</a>\n           <div class=\"button-and-tooltip\">\n            <button class=\"more-info\" aria-describedby=\"more-info-desc-1\"> \n             <svg height=\"15\" role=\"presentation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\">\n              <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M256 8C119.043 8 8 119.083 8 256c0 136.997 111.043 248 248 248s248-111.003 248-248C504 119.083 392.957 8 256 8zm0 110c23.196 0 42 18.804 42 42s-18.804 42-42 42-42-18.804-42-42 18.804-42 42-42zm56 254c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12h-88c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h12v-64h-12c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h64c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v100h12c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v24z\" />\n             </svg> \n             <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Focus to learn more</span> \n            </button> <!-- tooltip description -->\n            <div role=\"tooltip\" id=\"more-info-desc-1\">\n             <span class=\"left-corner\"></span> arXiv-issued DOI via DataCite\n            </div>\n           </div></td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"submission-history\">\n     <h2>Submission history</h2>\n     From: Hao Kang [<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/show-email/10ab0e7e/2611.12304\" rel=\"nofollow\">view email</a>]\n     <br>\n     <strong><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304v1\" rel=\"nofollow\">[v1]</a></strong> Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:26:02 UTC (876 KB)\n     <br>\n     <strong>[v2]</strong> Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:20:30 UTC (867 KB)\n     <br>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end leftcolumn-->\n   <div class=\"extra-services\">\n    <div class=\"full-text\">\n     <a name=\"other\"></a> <span class=\"descriptor\">Full-text links:</span>\n     <h2>Access Paper:</h2>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.12304\" aria-describedby=\"download-button-info\" accesskey=\"f\" class=\"abs-button download-pdf\">View PDF</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2611.12304v2\" class=\"abs-button\" id=\"latexml-download-link\">HTML (experimental)</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/src/2611.12304\" class=\"abs-button download-eprint\">TeX Source </a></li>\n     </ul>\n     <div class=\"abs-license\">\n      <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" title=\"Rights to this article\" class=\"has_license\"> <img alt=\"license icon\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://arxiv.org/icons/licenses/by-nc-sa-4.0.png\"> <span>view license</span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <!--end full-text-->\n    <div class=\"extra-third-party\">\n     <h3>Additional Features</h3>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/audio/2611.12304\" class=\"abs-button download-audio\">Audio Summary</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"browse\">\n     <h3 class=\"browse-context-heading\">Current browse context:</h3>\n     <div class=\"current\">cs.DC</div>\n     <div class=\"prevnext\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button prev-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2611.12304&amp;function=prev&amp;context=cs.DC\" accesskey=\"p\" title=\"previous in cs.DC (accesskey p)\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;&nbsp;prev</a> </span> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">&nbsp; | &nbsp;</span> <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button next-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2611.12304&amp;function=next&amp;context=cs.DC\" accesskey=\"n\" title=\"next in cs.DC (accesskey n)\" rel=\"nofollow\">next&nbsp;&gt;</a> </span>\n      <br>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"list\">\n      <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-new\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.DC/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">new</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-recent\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.DC/recent\" rel=\"nofollow\">recent</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-id\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.DC/2026-11\" rel=\"nofollow\">2026-11</a>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"abs-switch-cat\">\n      Change to browse by:\n      <div class=\"switch context-change\">\n       <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304?context=cs\" rel=\"nofollow\">cs</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <h3>References &amp; Citations</h3>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-ads\" href=\"https://scixplorer.org/abs/arXiv:2611.12304\">SciX</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-google-scholar\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?arxiv_id=2611.12304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Scholar</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-semantic-scholar\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/arXiv:2611.12304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Semantic Scholar</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <button type=\"button\" id=\"bib-cite-trigger\" class=\"bib-cite-button abs-button\">export BibTeX citation</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bookmarks\">\n     <div>\n      <h3>Bookmark</h3>\n     </div>\n     <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"http://www.bibsonomy.org/BibtexHandler?requTask=upload&amp;url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304&amp;description=Evolving Infra: Agent-Adaptive LLM Serving at Scale\" title=\"Bookmark on BibSonomy\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/bibsonomy.png\" alt=\"BibSonomy\"> </a> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"https://reddit.com/submit?url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12304&amp;title=Evolving Infra: Agent-Adaptive LLM Serving at Scale\" title=\"Bookmark on Reddit\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/reddit.png\" alt=\"Reddit\"> </a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end extra-services-->\n   <!-- LABS AREA -->\n   <div id=\"labstabs\"></div>\n   <!-- END LABS AREA -->\n   <div class=\"endorsers\">\n    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/auth/show-endorsers/2611.12304\" class=\"endorser-who\" rel=\"nofollow\">Which authors of this paper are endorsers?</a> | Disable MathJax (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/mathjax.html\">What is MathJax?</a>) <span class=\"help\" style=\"font-style: normal; float: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 1em;\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Evolving Infra 是一种服务框架，可在运行时根据智能体工作负载调整计算资源分配和 KV 缓存管理；与 NVIDIA 的 Dynamo 相比，其延迟最高可降低 4.1x，首 token 时间最高可缩短 14x。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Evolving Infra 是一种服务框架，可在运行时根据智能体工作负载调整计算资源分配和 KV 缓存管理；与 NVIDIA 的 Dynamo 相比，其延迟最高可降低 4.1x，首 token 时间最高可缩短 14x。",
  "summary": "本文介绍了 Evolving Infra，这是一种面向智能体工作负载的自适应 LLM 服务框架，旨在解决现有预填充与解码分离系统的局限。该框架将计算资源分配与 KV 缓存管理解耦，使节点能够在预填充和解码模式之间高效切换。在线规划器会根据工作负载构成动态调整预填充与解码的拆分方式；具备智能体感知能力的分布式 KV 管理器则利用智能体上下文管理提供的信号，指导缓存淘汰和传输。在最多使用 300 GPUs 的环境中，针对 GLM-5.2 和 Kimi K2.6 进行的评估显示，与 NVIDIA 的 Dynamo 相比，Evolving Infra 可将端到端请求平均延迟最高降低 4.1x，将 P95 首 token 时间最高缩短 14x。该系统已开源，可用于实际部署。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Evolving Infra 为智能体工作负载解耦计算资源分配与 KV 缓存管理",
      "explanation": "这使节点能够在预填充和解码模式之间高效切换，解决现有预填充与解码分离系统中的负载不均和 KV 缓存淘汰问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "在线规划器会根据工作负载构成动态调整预填充与解码的拆分方式",
      "explanation": "规划器会根据智能体工作负载的具体构成，在运行时调整计算资源分配，从而优化资源利用率。"
    },
    {
      "point": "具备智能体感知能力的分布式 KV 管理器利用智能体上下文信号指导缓存淘汰",
      "explanation": "与粗粒度信号不同，该管理器利用来自智能体上下文管理的细粒度信号，保留智能体后续会再次使用的 KV 缓存。"
    },
    {
      "point": "评估显示，与 Dynamo 相比，延迟最高降低 4.1x，P95 TTFT 改善最高达 14x",
      "explanation": "在最多使用 300 GPUs 的环境中，该框架针对 GLM-5.2 和 Kimi K2.6 进行测试，在编程、数学和计算机操作任务上的表现显著优于 NVIDIA 的生产级框架。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "智能体工作负载是 LLM 推理需求的重要来源。",
    "我们推出了 Evolving Infra，这是一种面向智能体的自适应服务框架，可在运行时根据智能体工作负载调整计算资源分配，并根据智能体上下文管理调整 KV 缓存管理。",
    "与 NVIDIA 的生产级框架 Dynamo 相比，Evolving Infra 可将端到端请求平均延迟和 P95 TTFT 最高分别降低 4.1x 和 14x。"
  ],
